@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans SC
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 45
hide empty members
title B02 类图 - 预订组合, 独立资源与受控修改
class Reservation <<aggregate root>> {
  -id: ReservationId
  -customerId: UserId
  -state: OrderState
  -plan: StayPlan
  -guest: GuestInfo
  -total: Money
  -version: Long
  -confirmationDeadlineUtc: Instant
  -actualCheckinUtc: Instant?
  +confirm(t: Instant, v: Long): void
  +amendStay(c: StayChange): void
  +correctGuest(c: GuestChange): void
  +cancel(t: Instant): void
  +expire(t: Instant, v: Long): void
  +checkIn(a: RoomAllocation): void
  +complete(t: Instant): void
}
class StayPlan <<immutable value>> {
  -hotelId: HotelId
  -roomTypeId: RoomTypeId
  -checkin: LocalDate
  -checkout: LocalDate
  -quantity: Int
  +nightDates(): List<LocalDate>
}
class BookedNight <<owned entity>> {
  -stayDate: LocalDate
  -roomTypeId: RoomTypeId
  -unitPrice: Money
  -quantity: Int
  -reservedQuantity: Int
  ~releaseAllocation(): void
  +lineTotal(): Money
}
class RoomAssignment <<owned entity>> {
  -roomId: RoomId
  -checkinUtc: Instant
  -checkoutUtc: Instant?
  ~finish(t: Instant): void
}
class DayOffer <<aggregate root>> {
  -roomTypeId: RoomTypeId
  -stayDate: LocalDate
  -capacity: Int
  -reservedUnits: Int
  -unitPrice: Money?
  -stopSale: Boolean
  -version: Long
  +available(): Int
  +applyDelta(delta: Int): void
  +revise(c: SellingChange): void
}
class Room <<aggregate root>> {
  -id: RoomId
  -hotelId: HotelId
  -roomTypeId: RoomTypeId
  -state: RoomState
  -occupiedOrderId: ReservationId?
  +occupy(order: ReservationId): void
  +markDirty(order: ReservationId): void
  +markClean(): void
  +startMaintenance(): void
  +finishMaintenance(): void
}
class PriceQuote <<immutable quote>> {
  -id: QuoteId
  -customerId: UserId
  -purpose: QuotePurpose
  -targetOrderId: ReservationId?
  -targetOrderVersion: Long?
  -planHash: String
  -nightRates: Map<LocalDate,Money>
  -total: Money
  +matches(c: QuoteCheck): Boolean
}
class Submission <<aggregate root>> {
  -actorId: UserId
  -operationId: UUID
  -action: String
  -payloadHash: String
  -state: OperationState
  -result: CommandResult?
  +bind(action: String, hash: String): void
  +finish(r: CommandResult): void
  +replay(): CommandResult
}
Submission -[hidden]right-> Reservation
Reservation -[hidden]right-> PriceQuote
StayPlan -[hidden]right-> BookedNight
BookedNight -[hidden]right-> RoomAssignment
DayOffer -[hidden]right-> Room
Reservation "1" *-down- "1" StayPlan
Reservation "1" *-down- "1..*" BookedNight
Reservation "1" *-down- "0..*" RoomAssignment
BookedNight --> DayOffer : 引用独立日售键
RoomAssignment --> Room : 引用独立实体房
PriceQuote ..> StayPlan : 内容绑定
Submission ..> Reservation : 结果引用
note bottom of Reservation
无setState/setPrice/setDeadline.
StayChange含新计划, 已接受报价, T和expectedVersion.
GuestChange含入住人, T和expectedVersion.
T在本分支全部锁齐后取得, 方法再次检查状态与期限.
Money和GuestInfo为不可变值, 详见正文.
end note
note bottom of Room
已入住时恰有q条不同房号的活动分配.
Room.occupiedOrderId必须与活动分配一致.
任一房号不合规则整个入住事务失败.
end note
@enduml
